This article lists the CoroCoro merchandise of [[The Battle Cats]].

==Magazine==
Many issues of CoroCoro feature regular [[Cat Units]] or [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] with a different face, although they may not be the main article of the monthly CoroCoro issues, sometimes they make brief appearances on the advertisement pages. Some feature free bonus merchandise that buyers can obtain.
